    "description": "Information on every egg and chick laid and hatched in one study plot, the Tower, on Middleton Island. One file per year, 2004-2009 (ongoing project). One line per egg. It contains the identity of the parents, the dates of laying, hatching, lost or death, the measurements of the egg and chick (measurements every 5 days after hatching), etc.",
